<https://joinedcontext.com/models/sdm/extensions/WaterBodyStatus> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "WaterBodyStatus" ;
    dcterms:license "https://joinedcontext.com/licenses/cc-by-4.0" ;
    dcterms:title "WaterBodyStatus, an extension of dataModel.PointOfInterest/PointOfInterest" ;
    skos:definition "A water body with its ecological status or potential class. Extends dataModel.PointOfInterest/PointOfInterest: WaterQualityObserved and WaterObserved require dateObserved and hold measured parameters; these rows are assessed classes of a located water body." .

